{
  "name": "[Sandbox] WF2 Response handler",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "b159b1ea-ca7e-48f3-a667-6f10d0d000f1",
      "name": "Note: overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF2 Response handler\nServes the confirm pages behind every instructor button. The database renders the HTML.\n\n- **GET** `/webhook/sandbox-respond?t=<token>` → `response_page` (shows the page, records nothing).\n- **POST** `/webhook/sandbox-respond` (the form on that page) → `submit_response_page` (records the answer) → pokes WF4 so follow-up messages go out now.\n- If the database cannot be reached, a friendly error page is shown and the execution is marked failed (WF5 alerts the admin).\n\nSave the production URL in the database: `app_config.response_base_url` = `https://<your-n8n>/webhook/sandbox-respond`.\n\n**Edit only the Config node.**",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dee1f156-3d2d-46b1-8b14-6c67497e0c35",
      "name": "Page opened (GET)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "sandbox-respond",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "ignoreBots": true
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "e149db65-6c9f-595a-aaf7-c2bd89aa9bc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3155ab1-d74d-43e8-9280-bf5ec4b1ebf1",
      "name": "Answer submitted (POST)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "sandbox-respond",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "f1ea2e9a-041c-5de4-af4e-fbff759fba4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "6e8db329-a57e-4756-9571-b918a36cd146",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        150
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// EDIT THESE VALUES (one place per workflow). No other node needs changing.\nconst supabaseUrl = 'https://abcdefghijklmnopqrst.supabase.co';      // Supabase project URL\nconst pokeUrl = 'https://your-instance.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/sandbox-sme-poke';          // WF4 \"Action runner\" production webhook URL\nconst pokeKey = 'REPLACE_WITH_POKE_SECRET';                   // same value as the \"Poke secret\" credential\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  supabaseUrl: supabaseUrl.replace(/\\/+$/, ''),\n  pokeUrl,\n  pokeKey,\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "63aeb608-30c7-49a2-9a09-2e1ef46cdfc2",
      "name": "Is it a submit?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        150
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "aa23e6d6-eb21-401f-b19c-fbed6318de40",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Answer submitted (POST)').isExecuted }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0f1f1fc7-3179-46e0-8a85-b5b728c822f4",
      "name": "Render page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.supabaseUrl }}/rest/v1/rpc/response_page",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "Accept",
              "value": "text/html"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ p_token: String($('Page opened (GET)').first().json.query.t || '') }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "text",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "Supabase Sandbox"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec913887-cc5c-4724-8633-bc0d69de9171",
